["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/eli", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[European Legislation Identifier (ELI)](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/content/help/eurlex-content/eli.html) is a Uniform Resource Identifier (URI) that uniquely identifies a legal resource, typically consisting of a document type, adoption year, and document number (e.g., `http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/2847/oj`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
